---
// src/components/CheaperAds.astro
---

<section class="w-full py-24 md:py-32 bg-white border-y border-slate-200/50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 md:gap-24 items-center">
            
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
                    Why does a slow website cost you money?
                </h2>
                
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Think of ad platforms like Facebook and Google as a toll highway. They want traffic to move fast and keep people happy.
                </p>
                <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                    If your website takes too long to load, people click your ad, get annoyed waiting, and immediately leave. <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Ad algorithms hate this.</strong>
                </p>
                
                <div class="pl-6 border-l-2 border-red-500">
                    <h4 class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">The Penalty</h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium">
                        Ad platforms will secretly force you to pay <span class="text-red-600 font-semibold">double the price</span> just to show your ads to the exact same people.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-[#FBFBFD] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-8">
                        <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span> Unoptimized Site
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-red-600 font-semibold text-xs">Low Search Visibility</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 mb-6">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Cost Per Click</div>
                            <div class="text-3xl text-slate-900 font-bold tracking-tight">RM 3.50</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Visitors</div>
                            <div class="text-3xl text-slate-900 font-bold tracking-tight">100</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Total Spent:</span>
                        <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-xl">RM 350.00</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] relative">
                    <div class="absolute -top-3 right-8 bg-[#2563EB] text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-md">
                        YOU SAVE MONEY
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-8">
                        <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2.5">
                            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB]"></span> High Performance
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-[#2563EB] font-semibold text-xs">Search Priority</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end border-b border-slate-100 pb-6 mb-6">
                        <div>
                            <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Cost Per Click</div>
                            <div class="text-3xl text-slate-900 font-bold tracking-tight">RM 1.50</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-right">
                            <div class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-2 font-medium">Visitors</div>
                            <div class="text-3xl text-slate-900 font-bold tracking-tight">233</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Total Spent:</span>
                        <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-xl">RM 350.00</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>